flowchart LR
  subgraph FreezeFrame
    P1[player 1 x,y,mate]
    P2[player 2 x,y,mate]
    Pk[... up to max]
    PAD[padded slots]
  end
  P1 --> PHI[shared phi MLP]
  P2 --> PHI
  Pk --> PHI
  PAD -. mask=0 .-> POOL
  PHI --> POOL[masked mean pool]
  POOL --> CAT[concat with ball features]
  BALL[ball x,y] --> CAT
  CAT --> RHO[rho head]
  RHO --> OUT[goal probability]
